# Example: @isr_group with WCET budget.  Compile with:
#   vredrs build samples/isr_demo.cpps -o /tmp/isr --raw
# The handler is registered in the .isr section with priority and budget.
# The C* PIR backend statically estimates WCET and rejects handlers whose
# estimated cycle count exceeds the budget.

@isr_group(budget_us=100, priority=1)
fn, timer_irq()
    set, counter = 0
/end
